    141				     ;==========================================================================
    142				     ;
    143				     ;	Game Entry Point
    144				     ;
    145				     ;	Called from zeliad.exe with AX = mode flag:
    146				     ;	  AX = 0      New game
    147				     ;	  AX = 0xFFFF Load saved game
    148				     ;
    149				     ;	Initialization flow:
    150				     ;	  1. Load SAR chunk loader / jump table
    151				     ;	  2. Clear all game state variables
    152				     ;	  3. Load graphics driver for current video mode
    153				     ;	  4. Branch: new game vs. load save
    154				     ;	  5. Load all game subsystems (physics,	combat,	AI, etc.)
    155				     ;	  6. Initialize	palette, music,	level data
    156				     ;	  7. Jump to main game loop
    157				     ;
    158				     ;==========================================================================
    159
    160	0000			     game	     proc    far
    161
    162	0000			     start:
